<Base title="Contact" description="Email Sarah at cannedlatte.com: corrections and missing cans, brand press kits and samples, or the featured sponsor slot.">
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p class="lede">There's one inbox and it's mine: <a href="mailto:hello@cannedlatte.com">hello@cannedlatte.com</a>.</p>

  <h2>Drinkers</h2>
  <p>Found a number that looks wrong, or a can I don't have yet? Email me. A photo of the label is the best thing you can send, because I can fix a record from one in about a minute. Corrections go up fast.</p>

  <h2>Brands</h2>
  <p>Press kits, product photos, launch news, samples: all welcome, and samples get photographed and measured like everything else. If you run an affiliate program, I'd like to hear about it.</p>

  <h2>Sponsors</h2>
  <p>There's one featured slot on the site. Details are on the <a href="/advertise">advertise page</a>.</p>
</Base>
